{"seq":3,"slug":"discourse-analysis","title":"话语分析","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis","introMarkdown":"# 话语分析 简介\n\n话语分析将语言视为社会实践，研究语言使用如何建构意义、塑造身份并维系或挑战权力关系。作为一个横跨语言学、社会学和文学研究的交叉领域，话语分析为研究生提供了一套独特的分析工具，用以揭示文本背后的社会运作机制。\n\n本课程包含四个章节，从理论根基到实践应用逐层展开。第一章**话语分析基础**涵盖话语理论的哲学渊源、言语行为理论和会话分析三大奠基性议题，帮助学习者建立话语研究的核心概念框架。第二章**批判性话语分析**以 Fairclough 的批评话语分析模型为出发点，深入探讨权力与话语的关系以及媒体话语分析的方法，展示话语分析如何揭示社会不平等的语言机制。第三章**多模态话语分析**将分析视野从纯文本扩展到视觉、符号和数字空间，依次介绍视觉话语分析、多模态符号学和数字话语分析的理论与方法。第四章**话语分析应用**聚焦政治话语、学术话语和机构话语三个典型场域，展示话语分析在不同社会领域的实际运用。\n\n建议学习者在学习过程中收集真实语料进行分析练习，将理论工具与具体材料紧密结合。同时注意不同话语分析流派之间的分歧，批判性地反思每种方法的适用范围和局限性。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"话语分析基础","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"discourse-theory","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 话语理论基础","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/foundations/discourse-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"speech-act-theory","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 言语行为理论","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/foundations/speech-act-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conversation-analysis","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 会话分析","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/foundations/conversation-analysis"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"critical-discourse","title":"批判性话语分析","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/critical-discourse","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fairclough-cda","title":"研究生 话语分析 — Fairclough 批评话语分析","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/critical-discourse/fairclough-cda"},{"seq":2,"slug":"power-and-discourse","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 权力与话语","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/critical-discourse/power-and-discourse"},{"seq":3,"slug":"media-discourse","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 媒体话语分析","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/critical-discourse/media-discourse"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"multimodal","title":"多模态话语分析","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/multimodal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"visual-discourse","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 视觉话语分析","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/multimodal/visual-discourse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multimodal-semiotics","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 多模态符号学","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/multimodal/multimodal-semiotics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-discourse","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 数字话语分析","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/multimodal/digital-discourse"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"话语分析应用","docCount":3,"url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"political-discourse","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 政治话语分析","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/applications/political-discourse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"academic-discourse","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 学术话语分析","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/applications/academic-discourse"},{"seq":3,"slug":"institutional-discourse","title":"研究生 话语分析 — 机构话语分析","url":"/education/graduate/literature/discourse-analysis/applications/institutional-discourse"}]}]}